<div class="heatingM-specs__card heatingM-specs__card--care">
  <h3 class="heatingM-specs__card-title">Care Instructions</h3>

  <div class="heatingM-specs__care-list">
    <div class="heatingM-specs__care-item">
      <span class="heatingM-specs__care-icon" aria-hidden="true">▣</span>
      <div>
        <h4>Machine Washable</h4>
        <p>Remove power connections before placing in washing machine.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="heatingM-specs__care-item">
      <span class="heatingM-specs__care-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
      <div>
        <h4>Remove Power Components</h4>
        <p>Always disconnect cables and batteries before cleaning.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="heatingM-specs__care-item">
      <span class="heatingM-specs__care-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
      <div>
        <h4>Do Not Dry Clean</h4>
        <p>Avoid harsh chemical cleaning methods to protect the elements.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="heatingM-specs__care-item">
      <span class="heatingM-specs__care-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
      <div>
        <h4>Do Not Iron</h4>
        <p>Avoid direct heat on the garment to protect interior wiring.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="heatingM-specs__card-divider"></div>
  <p class="heatingM-specs__card-note">Recommended: Hand wash for maximum longevity. Dry flat in shade.</p>
</div>
